{
  "format": "shaderlab-conformance-core",
  "version": 1,
  "subject": "r_noise body seed: 32-bit FNV-1a over the UTF-8 bytes of the RenderContext body ID (card_id, message_id or candidate_id), then noise chunk 0 for that seed",
  "notes": [
    "Recipe from RFC1840 at f394725 (open; not adopted). Computed independently with a Python FNV-1a (offset 0x811c9dc5, prime 0x01000193, xor then multiply mod 2^32) and hashlib.blake2b(pack('<II', seed, 0), digest_size=32).",
    "The ID is hashed exactly as given: no Unicode normalization, trimming or case folding. utf8Hex pins the exact input bytes.",
    "Reference derivation only: these vectors do not show that a renderer or host supplies this seed today."
  ],
